  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Cooperation Facility (TCF) under AAP 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Cooperation Facility (CF) covers support to (i) the implementation of the MIP, TEIs and other programmes, (ii) policy dialogues with governments and other key stakeholders, (iii) to support the Tanzania Civil Aviation Authority in addressing identified safety issues following the European Authority for Aviation Safety (EASA)&#xbf;s committee outcome, (iv) business missions and export promotion activities; (v) studies to inform business environment reforms ; and (vi) strategic communication and public diplomacy</narrative>
  </description>
